// Studio publish flow + viewer, PASS2-PAGES rows PUB-01/02/03/04/06/07/08/10/11/15/16 and VIEW-04/07 plus the viewer-link origin (flags NEXT_PUBLIC_STUDIO_P2_PUBLISH,
// NEXT_PUBLIC_STUDIO_P2_PUBLISH_INBOX and NEXT_PUBLIC_STUDIO_P2_PUBLISH_ORIGIN_URL): the exact text this change adds to or swaps in the files it touches, so a pin that
// holds one of them to an earlier commit can first put the base text back (stripP2Publish(rel, text)), the way the other *-strip.mjs files do.
// scripts/test-studio-p2-publish.mjs proves that stripping gives back the base commit's file byte for byte, so nothing is changed that is not listed here, and that every
// listed change is inert with the flags off. New files (no base text to put back): components/publish-p2.tsx, components/studio-viewer-theme-provider.tsx, lib/studio-p2-publish.ts.

